6. ICONS

---
- Basic Icon
```mdx
{% icon name="lightbulb" / %}
```
{% icon name="lightbulb" / %}

---
- Colored Icon (_with Tailwind v4 colors_)
```mdx
{% icon name="circle-check" class="text-green-500" / %}
```
{% icon name="circle-check" class="text-green-500" / %}

---
- Icons of different sizes (_with Tailwind v4 utility classes_)
```mdx
<!-- Small size -->
{% icon name="lightbulb" class="w-4 h-4" / %}

<!-- default size -->
{% icon name="lightbulb" / %}

<!-- large size -->
{% icon name="lightbulb" class="w-6 h-6" / %}
```
Small size (_w-4 h-4_): {% icon name="lightbulb" class="w-4 h-4" / %}

Default size: {% icon name="lightbulb" / %}

Large size (_w-12 h-12_): {% icon name="lightbulb" class="w-12 h-12" / %}


---
- Additional custom styling
```mdx
{% icon name="triangle-alert" class="text-rose-500 aspect-square w-12 h-12 bg-rose-200 p-1 rounded-lg" / %}
```
{% icon name="triangle-alert" class="text-rose-500 aspect-square w-12 h-12 bg-rose-200 p-1 rounded-lg border-2 shadow-xl" / %}
> 

{% callout type="tip" title="Note" %}
- You can add as many tailwind css styles as you like.
- The utility classes used should target (be applicable) to an HTMLSvgElement
{% /callout %}

